# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile actually COPYs.
#
# Without this file the daemon uploads the whole checkout -- measured at 1.4 GB
# here (.venv 466 MB, evaluation 598 MB, app 284 MB, .git 21 MB) -- and the
# COPY src/ step also picked up src/__pycache__ with host .pyc files.

.git/
.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# The image bakes in the nine FP16 members and hand_landmarker.task (Dockerfile
# COPYs models/), because a run must work with no host mounts. Keeping the
# context small is what this file is for, not excluding those.

# Research trees, datasets, clips and Android sources the image never uses.
evaluation/
# app/ is NOT excluded wholesale: the Dockerfile needs app/smoke_test.py.
# The Android sources under it are the 284 MB, so exclude those specifically.
app/android_final/
app/offline_demo.py
clemchris/
hengck/
hoyso_infer/
hoyso_train/
submission_final/
docs/
results/research/
.github/

# Large media / archives present in the checkout.
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.zip
*.pdf
*.ipynb